Subject: [PATCH 2/2] xattr: prevent NULL ptr deref warnings in __simple_xattr_set
Date: Fri, 14 Sep 2012 21:35:54 +0200
Message-Id: <1347651354-16289-2-git-send-email-levinsasha928@gmail.com>
